        "id": 127561,
        "name": "phantaskippy",
        "username": "phantaskippy",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-01-15T03:19:30.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>We had an amazing game with Guise and PW Fanatic. &nbsp;Also Guise pinging Cryo Bot (at +1 because Champion Bot) with his base power since all villains had -1 taken.</p><p>But in the middle of his throwdown he copies Fanatic's base power redirecting the 5 radiant because even a Barbaric Guise couldn't hit himself through that Chainmail Bikini, then put Best Card ever into play from atop his deck (thanks Tempest) and played I think three more cards before his fun ended (for that turn at least).</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>PW Fanatic is awesome, and gives Guise a great base power to copy.</p>",
        "post_number": 4,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:02:11.725Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 0,
        "reads": 0,
