        "raw": "<p>We had an amazing game with Guise and PW Fanatic. &nbsp;Also Guise pinging Cryo Bot (at +1 because Champion Bot) with his base power since all villains had -1 taken.</p><p>But in the middle of his throwdown he copies Fanatic&#39;s base power redirecting the 5 radiant because even a Barbaric Guise couldn&#39;t hit himself through that Chainmail Bikini, then put Best Card ever into play from atop his deck (thanks Tempest) and played I think three more cards before his fun ended (for that turn at least).</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>PW Fanatic is awesome, and gives Guise a great base power to copy.</p>",
